{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> and turn a small, rundown space into the bar of your dreams. Serve great drinks, keep your guests satisfied, and grow your business through smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.mp4?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is key to attracting customers. Spend your initial budget wisely buy essential supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.webm?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.mp4?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPAND YOUR MENU AND MASTER YOUR CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, unlock new ingredients, master recipes, and create drinks your guests will love. Experiment with different styles, develop your signature touch, and leave your mark on the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.webm?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.mp4?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BALANCE IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running a successful pub isn\u2019t just about pouring drinks. Manage your stock, keep an eye on expenses, and respond to customer demands. Invest wisely bad decisions can put your business at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.webm?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.mp4?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AN IMMERSIVE PUB MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its deep management system, evolving gameplay, and realistic pub-building mechanics, <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> offers a truly satisfying journey. Transform dust into charm, and build the pub you've always dreamed of become the heart of your neighborhood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.webm?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.mp4?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no limit to how far you can go. Build your dream pub, become the local favorite, and rise to the top of the bar scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't miss this realistic pub management sim Wishlist <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> now and be among the first to play!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3390160?t=1753468205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/c2ebecf9b5f207f32010d7ad386d49ca3fa7e139/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753468205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/a50e6e0aa9dde69ecbc52355eb29e1b1519e6912/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753468205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/a50e6e0aa9dde69ecbc52355eb29e1b1519e6912/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753468205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game offers a virtual pub management experience and includes:\r\n\r\n- Gameplay mechanics involving the sale of alcohol.\r\n\r\n- Scenes that feature alcohol as part of the simulation elements, without promoting its consumption.\r\n\r\nThe game is designed as an entertaining management simulation and does not intend to encourage real-life alcohol use. Players are encouraged to make responsible decisions as a pub owner."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> and turn a small, rundown space into the bar of your dreams. Serve great drinks, keep your guests satisfied, and grow your business through smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.mp4?t=1753468205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is key to attracting customers. Spend your initial budget wisely buy essential supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1753468205\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste